  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe [HTML definition ](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#hostensurecancompilestrings(realm)) of HostEnsureCanCompileString doesn't match the [ECMAScript definition](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-hostensurecancompilestrings).\r\n\r\nThe call to EnsureCSPDoesNotBlockStringCompilation also doesn't match the [CSP definition](https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#ref-for-can-compile-strings)",
